{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Untold Chronicles: The Harvest \u2013 Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you play the <strong>first 20 minutes</strong> of the full experience of <strong><i>Untold Chronicles: The Harvest</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story begins with <strong>Julio</strong>, a young man who travels to the countryside for a weekend to help his grandfather with the harvest. However, upon arrival he discovers his grandfather is not there. Calmly, he decides to wait, thinking he is alone among the vast cornfields \u2014 unaware that this initial tranquility will soon turn into something far darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What seems like a simple rest in the fields slowly turns into an unsettling atmosphere, where every detail hints that something is wrong. Very soon, Julio will realize that <strong>he will not be the one who harvests\u2026 but the one who is harvested</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is intended to introduce you to the atmosphere and tone of the final game, showing its <strong>true opening</strong> as you will experience it in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on atmosphere, tension, and a constant sense of dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, linear narrative with unexpected twists that linger beyond the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic visual style that maximizes immersion in every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed sound design that uses silence and noise as tools of fear.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3965130?t=1759359792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.stea