s=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration designed to fully immerse you in the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, linear narrative with unexpected twists that linger beyond the ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic visual style that maximizes immersion in every detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed sound design that uses silence and noise as tools of fear.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Glintle Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3388330","name":"Untold Chronicles: The Harvest"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3965130/7b45d25b3417eaa407fe08d734bae974eebe4502/header.jpg?t=1759359792","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965130/1752148048/5c5bdc58b53d2cfdaca0c36d6dcdc7cf710ed4df/1755581743/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759359406","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965130/1752148048/5c5bdc58b53d2cfdaca0c36d6dcdc7cf710ed4df/1755581743/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759359406","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3965130/1752148048/5c5bdc58b53d2cfdaca0c36d6dcdc7cf710ed4df/1755581743/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759359406","id":257185248,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185248/movie480.mp4?t=1759359406","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185248/movie_max.mp4?t=1759359406"},"name":"The Harvest - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_